saves her banana peels,"},{"s":10.32,"e":12.14,"text":"Drops them where the garden heals,"},{"s":12.14,"e":13.92,"text":"Coffee grounds and apple cores,"},{"s":13.92,"e":15.7,"text":"Making life from kitchen floors."},{"s":15.7,"e":17.58,"text":"Me, I’d probably use the trash,"},{"s":17.5,"e":19.24,"text":"Toss it quick and make a dash,"},{"s":19.24,"e":21.04,"text":"Neither choice should start a war—"},{"s":20.96,"e":22.72,"text":"Still, we ought to talk some more."},{"s":22.72,"e":23.22,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":22.72,"e":24.98,"text":"Because silence stacks like plastic cups,"},{"s":24.98,"e":26.82,"text":"Tiny tension building up,"},{"s":26.82,"e":29,"text":"Everybody nods along,"},{"s":29,"e":32.9,"text":"Even when the rhythm’s wrong."},{"s":32.9,"e":33.4,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":32.9,"e":36.18,"text":"Say the little thing, sing the simple thought,"},{"s":36.18,"e":39.6,"text":"Speak about the stuff that everybody forgot."},{"s":39.62,"e":43.28,"text":"One banana peel won’t bring the system down,"},{"s":43.28,"e":46.94,"text":"But a million muted moments make a disconnected town."},{"s":46.9,"e":50.42,"text":"We’re synchronous in scrolling, disynchronous in soul,"},{"s":50.42,"e":53.96,"text":"Fighting over fragments while we’re forfeiting the whole."},{"s":53.96,"e":57.64,"text":"Maybe fixing everything begins with being real:"},{"s":57.64,"e":59.66,"text":"“My sister likes the compost—"},{"s":59.66,"e":62.76,"text":"I would trash the peel.”"},{"s":62.76,"e":63.26,"text":"**[Verse 2]**"},{"s":68.22,"e":70.28,"text":"Someone leaves the hallway light,"},{"s":70.28,"e":72.06,"text":"Someone says the lid’s too tight,"},{"s":72.06,"e":73.98,"text":"Someone never fills the tray,"},{"s":73.9,"e":76.02,"text":"Someone sighs and walks away."},{"s":76.02,"e":77.88,"text":"Little problems, left alone,"},{"s":77.88,"e":79.66,"text":"Turn to walls of hardened stone,"},{"s":79.66,"e":81.44,"text":"Not because they can’t be solved—"},{"s":81.36,"e":83.12,"text":"Nobody wants to get involved."},{"s":83.12,"e":84.9,"text":"We fear the clip, the quote, the crowd,"},{"s":84.9,"e":86.86,"text":"So every honest thought gets bowed,"},{"s":86.86,"e":88.56,"text":"Cancel culture, careful speech,"},{"s":88.56,"e":90.34,"text":"Common ground just out of reach."},{"s":90.34,"e":90.84,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":90.34,"e":92.02,"text":"We rehearse what won’t offend,"},{"s":92.02,"e":93.88,"text":"Then resent our closest friends,"},{"s":93.88,"e":95.68,"text":"Every whisper, every doubt"},{"s":95.68,"e":98.54,"text":"Needs a safe way to come out."},{"s":98.54,"e":99.04,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":98.54,"e":101.94,"text":"Say the little thing, sing the simple thought,"},{"s":101.94,"e":105.36,"text":"Speak about the stuff that everybody forgot."},{"s":105.6,"e":109.06,"text":"One banana peel won’t bring the system down,"},{"s":109.06,"e":112.62,"text":"But a million muted moments make a disconnected town."},{"s":112.62,"e":116.2,"text":"We’re synchronous in scrolling, disynchronous in soul,"},{"s":116.2,"e":119.76,"text":"Fighting over fragments while we’re forfeiting the whole."},{"s":119.76,"e":123.36,"text":"Maybe fixing everything begins with being real:"},{"s":123.36,"e":125.46,"text":"“My sister likes the compost—"},{"s":125.46,"e":128.36,"text":"I would trash the peel.”"},{"s":128.34,"e":128.84,"text":"**[Bridge]**"},{"s":128.34,"e":130.5,"text":"This isn’t really fruit or waste,"},{"s":130.42,"e":134.32,"text":"It’s how we share a home and space."},{"s":135.4,"e":138.04,"text":"It’s how we disagree with grace,"},{"s":138.04,"e":141.76,"text":"Without deleting someone’s face."},{"s":141.76,"e":144.18,"text":"No public trial, no scarlet sign,"},{"s":144.18,"e":148,"text":"Your tiny truth can live with mine."},{"s":148.68,"e":151.74,"text":"She sees soil—I see a bin;"},{"s":151.74,"e":155.04,"text":"Both of us can still begin."},{"s":156.14,"e":158.72,"text":"Talk about the toothpaste cap,"},{"s":158.72,"e":162.24,"text":"Talk about the thermostat,"},{"s":163.2,"e":166.36,"text":"Talk before the small mismatch"},{"s":166.36,"e":171.92,"text":"Turns into a social crash."},{"s":171.92,"e":172.42,"text":"**[Final Chorus]**"},{"s":173.32,"e":176.66,"text":"Say the little thing, sing the simple thought,"},{"s":176.66,"e":180.48,"text":"Most repair begins where conversation stopped."},{"s":180.48,"e":183.96,"text":"One banana peel may seem absurdly small,"},{"s":183.96,"e":187.64,"text":"But learning how to hear each other matters most of all."},{"s":187.64,"e":190.84,"text":"We’re synchronous in scrolling, disynchronous in soul,"},{"s":190.84,"e":194.52,"text":"Searching for perfection when connection is the goal."},{"s":194.52,"e":198.14,"text":"Maybe healing everything begins with being real:"},{"s":198.14,"e":200.26,"text":"“My sister makes it compost—"},{"s":200.26,"e":203.22,"text":"I would trash the peel.”"},{"s":203.22,"e":203.72,"text":"**[Outro]**"},{"s":203.22,"e":205.34,"text":"She can feed the flowers,"},{"s":205.34,"e":209.04,"text":"I can choose the can,"},{"s":210.3,"e":213.42,"text":"We can speak for thirty seconds"},{"s":213.42,"e":217.44,"text":"And still understand."},{"s":217.44,"e":219.36,"text":"Small words, soft truth,"},{"s":219.36,"e":221.24,"text":"No shame, no shield—"},{"s":221.42,"e":224.18,"text":"Sometimes peace begins"},{"s":224.18,"e":226.38,"text":"With a banana peel."}],"duration":233.72,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.476Z","stats":{"whisperWords":460,"polishedWords":460,"matched":449,"matchRate":0.976}}